  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Helsinki Citizens Assembly Vanadzor 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Helsinki Citizens Assembly Vanadzor 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helsinki Citizens Assembly Vanadzor (HCAV) planerar att genomf&#xf6;ra lokal valobservation inf&#xf6;r och under parlamentsvalet i Armenien. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den armeniska demokratin genom att skydda valens integritet och fr&#xe4;mja fria och r&#xe4;ttvisa val. Genom valobservation st&#xe4;rks &#xe4;ven medborgarnas tilltro till nationella och lokala myndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helsinki Citizens Assembly Vanadzor (HCAV) plans to conduct local election observation ahead of and during the parliamentary elections in Armenia. The goal is to strengthen Armenian democracy by protecting the integrity of elections and promoting free and fair elections. Election observation also strengthens citizens&apos; trust in national and local authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
